# Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD)

## Purpose

This document defines the relational database schema of the Police Case Management System (PCMS).

## Main Tables

- roles
- departments
- users
- cases
- case_assignments
- suspects
- attachments
- case_comments
- audit_logs

## Main Constraints

### Primary Keys

Each table has a technical primary key named `id`.

### Foreign Keys

- users.role_id → roles.id
- users.department_id → departments.id
- case_assignments.case_id → cases.id
- case_assignments.user_id → users.id
- suspects.case_id → cases.id
- attachments.case_id → cases.id
- case_comments.case_id → cases.id
- case_comments.user_id → users.id
- audit_logs.user_id → users.id

### Unique Constraints

- roles.name
- departments.code
- departments.name
- users.email
- cases.case_number
- case_assignments(case_id, user_id)

## Design Goals

- Referential integrity
- Scalability
- Traceability
- JPA compatibility
- Flyway readiness
